  "item_short_desc": "<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Stay comfortable and discreet with Rothco&rsquo;s Concealed Carry Zippered Hoodie. Designed for quick and easy access to firearm, this CCW hoodie features dual-access pass-through pockets, ensuring you&rsquo;re at the ready. Made from a high-performance material, the hoodie wicks away moisture to keep you dry and comfortable during daily wear. It&rsquo;s equipped with compact utility zip-pockets on each sleeve, perfect for carrying small essential items.</p>",
