  "description": "<p>Stay comfortable and discreet with Rothco&rsquo;s Concealed Carry Zippered Hoodie. Designed for quick and easy access to firearm, this CCW hoodie features dual-access pass-through pockets, ensuring you&rsquo;re at the ready. Made from a high-performance material, the hoodie wicks away moisture to keep you dry and comfortable during daily wear. It&rsquo;s equipped with compact utility zip-pockets on each sleeve, perfect for carrying small essential items. The left shoulder pocket includes a wire pass-through port for headphones or communication devices, while the 2-way zipper closure offers added convenience for accessing your waistband or duty belt. A loop field on the right sleeve allows for customization with flags or morale patches. Additionally, thumb holes in the cuffs prevent the sleeves from riding up, making this hoodie a functional yet comfortable option for professionals or anyone needing everyday carry gear.</p>",
